<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - First Boston's featured stocks.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - First Boston's featured stocks.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- CS First Boston said it named Monsanto Co and WorldCom Inc as its featured stocks of the week.</p>
<p>-- Monsanto is rated a buy, while WorldCom is rated a strong buy.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Monsanto gained 5/8 to 38-5/8 and WorldCom gained 3/8 to 23-1/4.</p>
</text>
